<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	   C/S =  3.82 %			C/S =  2.55 %</p>
<p>	   O/N =  1.27 %			O/N =  2.50 %</p>
<p>	   T/N =  1.27 %			T/N =  1.27 %</p>
<p>		 August 4, 1997		     Aug  1, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  3.40 %     1 month forward =  2.72 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  3.91 %     2 month forward =  3.05 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  3.97 %     3 month forward =  3.39 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  4.08 %     4 month forward =  3.40 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  4.42 %     5 month forward =  3.74 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  4.42 %     6 month forward =  3.85 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
